+    // LINKED volatile in Showdown — `addVolatile('trapped', source, move,
+    // 'trapper')` puts `trapper` on the user and `trapped` on the victim and
+    // links them, so the user leaving the field runs `clearVolatile()` ->
+    // `removeLinkedVolatiles()` and frees the victim. The trapper FAINTING frees
